   "stem": {
      "text": "Let F be the antiderivative of \\( f(x) = \\frac{1}{3 x + 1} \\) on the interval \\( x > -\\frac{1}{3} \\) with \\( F(1) = 2 \\). Find the exact value of \\( F\\left(5\\right) \\)."
   },
   "answer_key": {
      "form": "symbolic",
      "mathjson": [
